{"id":3609,"date":"2026-01-16T08:09:50","date_gmt":"2026-01-16T08:09:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/?p=3609"},"modified":"2026-01-21T01:28:23","modified_gmt":"2026-01-21T01:28:23","slug":"top-5-shampoo-manufacturers-in-china","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/top-5-shampoo-manufacturers-in-china\/","title":{"rendered":"Top 5 Shampoo Manufacturers in China"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">China\u2019s shampoo market includes well-established names and innovative newcomers, offering a spectrum of products from herbal formulas to modern salon-grade solutions. If you\u2019re a retailer, distributor, or industry observer looking for reliable manufacturers, this article profiles five leading shampoo producers in China known for quality, innovation, and market presence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-palette-color-5-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-palette-color-5-background-color has-background is-style-default\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-1-guangzhou-jindao-shampoo-factory\">\u2705 1. Guangzhou Qianlan Shampoo Factory<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Guangzhou Qianlan Shampoo Factory<\/strong> has focused on skincare and haircare products for many years, including body scrubs, body lotions, face creams and serums, shampoo sets, and hair care sets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Guangzhou Qianlan Shampoo Factory adheres to strict quality control and attentive customer service. Experienced staff are available 24\/7 to communicate your needs and ensure your complete satisfaction, whether you choose existing products or seek customized solutions. Our sales manager, with 16 years of export experience, will provide you with precise marketing strategies to help you sell your products quickly. In-stock products are shipped within 24 hours, and OEM products are shipped within 10 working days \u2013 these are our strengths. Our customers are located in North America, Latin America, the Middle East, and Asia.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-2.webp\" alt=\"Manufacturers in China\" class=\"wp-image-2551\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-2.webp 800w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-2-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-2-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-2-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our professional R&amp;D team explores new products and updates technology monthly. We own two factory parks with a total production area of \u200b\u200bover 120,000 square meters, and have ISO 22716 and GMPC certified workshops. Currently, 14 modern production lines have a monthly capacity of over 2 million sets to meet the needs of different customers. We operate our own shampoo brand and provide OEM\/ODM services.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/\">Click to view company and product introduction \u2197<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-2-shanghai-jahwa\">\u2705 2. Shanghai Jahwa<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Key Strengths<\/strong>: One of China\u2019s oldest and most trusted cosmetic and hair care enterprises, with deep understanding of <strong>local market preferences<\/strong>.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Notable Features<\/strong>: Known for classic brands such as <strong>Herborist<\/strong>\u200b and <strong>Liushen<\/strong>, integrating botanical ingredients with modern technology.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-3-yunnan-baiyao-group\">\u2705 3. Yunnan Baiyao Group<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Key Strengths<\/strong>: Leverages the <strong>Yunnan Baiyao tradition<\/strong>\u200b of Chinese medicine to create shampoos that promote scalp health and reduce irritation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Notable Features<\/strong>: The brand <strong>Yangyuanqing<\/strong>\u200b focuses on scalp care and TCM-based solutions for dandruff and hair loss.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-4-seeyoung\">\u2705 4. Seeyoung<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Key Strengths<\/strong>: A leading <strong>silicone-free shampoo brand<\/strong>\u200b emphasizing natural scalp care. It appeals to health-conscious consumers through products free of harsh chemicals.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Notable Features<\/strong>: Popular for ginger-based anti-hair loss shampoos and tea seed dandruff control formulas.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-5-adolph\">\u2705 5. Adolph <\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Key Strengths<\/strong>: Known for <strong>fragrance-focused hair care<\/strong>, positioning itself in the mid-to-high end market with perfumed shampoos and conditioners.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Notable Features<\/strong>: Emphasizes eco-friendly, skin-friendly ingredients combined with long-lasting scents.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-to-choose-a-shampoo-manufacturer-in-china\">\ud83d\udcc8 How to Choose a Shampoo Manufacturer in China<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Identify Your Needs<\/strong>: Determine market demands\u2014such as anti-hair fall, natural ingredients, or fragrance\u2014and match with a manufacturer\u2019s specialty.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check Certifications<\/strong>: Ensure the supplier follows quality standards (e.g., GMP, ISO) and has necessary product certifications.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Evaluate R&amp;D Capability<\/strong>: Brands with strong research teams (like Yunnan Baiyao and Seeyoung) offer better formula innovation and customization.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Consider Scalability<\/strong>: Large <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/\" type=\"link\" id=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/\">Shampoo manufacturers<\/a><\/strong> (e.g., Qianlan) provide stable supply for bulk orders, suitable for expanding businesses.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Tip: To make supplier selections, be sure to request samples, review production audit reports, and verify certifications for specific markets.<\/em><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>China\u2019s shampoo market includes well-established names and innovative newcomers, offering a spectrum of products from herbal formulas to modern salon-grade solutions.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2226,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[94,89],"class_list":["post-3609","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized","